# AjitSir Academy — MVP Phase 1 Implementation Plan

## Overview

Build the first production-ready version of AjitSir Academy — a mobile-first ed-tech platform for Maharashtra TET students. The MVP is centred around a **secure notes viewing system**, a homepage with an **announcement/video slider**, and a full **admin content management panel**.

This plan is designed to handle **1,000 concurrent users** without issues.

