**`NoteView`** — audit log of note views (for analytics, abuse detection):
```prisma
model NoteView {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId    String
  user      User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  noteId    String
  note      Note     @relation(fields: [noteId], references: [id])
  viewedAt  DateTime @default(now())
}
```

Also add `description`, `pageCount`, and `thumbnailKey` to the `Note` model for richer UI display.

