## Performance & Reliability (1,000 Users)

| Concern | Solution |
|---|---|
| API overload | Express already has rate limiting middleware; notes list is cacheable |
| PDF loading speed | PDF.js lazy renders pages — only renders visible page + 1 page ahead |
| Database queries | Prisma queries are already optimised; indexes on `subjectId`, `userId` |
| Static assets | Next.js serves CSS/JS with long-cache headers automatically |
| Signed URL theft | 5-minute TTL + user-specific token; URL is in memory only, not in DOM |
| Concurrent uploads | R2 handles upload concurrency; multer streams directly — no disk I/O |

